Chapter: ShieldData

 UOX3 base_armor_t2a.dfn shield def (GPL-2.0-or-later): bronze 10, buckler 7, metal kite 16, heater 23, metal 9,
 wooden kite 12, wooden 8, order 30, chaos 32. 0 is not a shield.
  shd-ar : Integer -> Integer
  shd-ar (g) = if g == #1B72 then 10 else if g == #1B73 then 7 else if g == #1B74 then 16 else if g == #1B76 then 23
    else if g == #1B7B then 9 else if g == #1B78 then 12 else if g == #1B7A then 8 else if g == #1BC4 then 30
    else if g == #1BC3 then 32 else 0

